WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Set a teacher PIN so only you can see class progress.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Create a class. It gets a 6-character class code.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.700
Print the join cards: one per student, with the code and three steps.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.500
Open the class report: speed, accuracy, weak keys and minutes for each student.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.200
Export it as a CSV file, or print save codes if a student loses progress.
